Description: asks once whether security updates should install automatically
 At login, every administrator account gets one question: install security
 updates from Debian automatically, or only show a notification. The answer
 "Install automatically" turns on unattended-upgrades after the
 administrator password. You can change it later with
 dpkg-reconfigure -plow unattended-upgrades.

