Description: Legion defaults for the XFCE desktop and the login screen
 The panel, desktop, terminal, keyboard shortcuts, window manager, power
 manager and appearance of Legion, the dark login screen with the Legion
 wallpaper, tap to click on touchpads and a drop-down terminal (Super+`).
 Most of the defaults are in the layer /etc/xdg/legion, which a script in
 /etc/X11/Xsession.d puts before /etc/xdg. Every account can change them
 in the XFCE settings, and apt keeps your changes to the files in /etc.

